{"id":"fb8f36dfc1604894","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-active-domain-safe-query.md","title":"活跃域、安全查询与论域无关性","display":"df-active-domain-safe-query — 活跃域、安全查询与论域无关性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-active-domain-safe-query","aliases":["29-df-active-domain-safe-query"],"display":"df-active-domain-safe-query — 活跃域、安全查询与论域无关性","depends_on":["[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-struc]]"],"source_locator":"Section 14.1.1, pp.223–224, scans238–239","source_basis":"原书文本层；论域无关性作为本地独立接口，未将其与安全性等同"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-active-domain-safe-query"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-active-domain-safe-query</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-active-domain-safe-query — 活跃域、安全查询与论域无关性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Section 14.1.1, pp.223–224, scans238–239"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书文本层；论域无关性作为本地独立接口，未将其与安全性等同"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle\\)</span> 为有限纯关系词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i\\geq1\">\\(a_i\\geq1\\)</span>，没有常量或函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>。以下均在元语言结构类上定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 为元语言查询函数，定义于全部非空有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-结构，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(A)\\subseteq|A|^k\">\\(q(A)\\subseteq|A|^k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\preccurlyeq_{\\rm ad}B\">\\(A\\preccurlyeq_{\\rm ad}B\\)</span> 只用于载体自然包含的结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{adom}_\\tau(A)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^r\\bigcup_{(b_1,\\ldots,b_{a_i})\\in R_i^A}\\{b_1,\\ldots,b_{a_i}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{adom}_\\tau(A)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^r\\bigcup_{(b_1,\\ldots,b_{a_i})\\in R_i^A}\\{b_1,\\ldots,b_{a_i}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Safe}_{\\tau,k}(q)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;q(A)\\subseteq\\operatorname{adom}_\\tau(A)^k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Safe}_{\\tau,k}(q)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;q(A)\\subseteq\\operatorname{adom}_\\tau(A)^k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\preccurlyeq_{\\rm ad}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ |A|\\subseteq|B|\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^r R_i^A=R_i^B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\preccurlyeq_{\\rm ad}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ |A|\\subseteq|B|\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^r R_i^A=R_i^B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DomInd}_{\\tau,k}(q)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;(A\\preccurlyeq_{\\rm ad}B\\to q(A)=q(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DomInd}_{\\tau,k}(q)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;(A\\preccurlyeq_{\\rm ad}B\\to q(A)=q(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书在印刷223页将安全性表述为输出元组的每个元素都出现在数据库关系中；224页通常直接取活跃域为整个论域。本条刻意限定无常量的关系数据库，以免把常量是否计入活跃域的另一约定混入书中表述。</p>\n<p>安全性只限制输出位置，不能自动保证扩大载体后答案不变。例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(A)=\\{x\\in S^A\\mid\\exists y\\in|A|\\setminus S^A\\}\">\\(q(A)=\\{x\\in S^A\\mid\\exists y\\in|A|\\setminus S^A\\}\\)</span> 总是安全；载体和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 都为单点时答案为空，添加一个不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 中的新点后答案变为原单点。因而不能仅凭 Safe 就援引论域无关查询语言的等价性；原书的活跃域论域约定须显式保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"a_i\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"q(A)\\subseteq|A|^k","display":false},{"tex":"A\\preccurlyeq_{\\rm ad}B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{adom}_\\tau(A)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^r\\bigcup_{(b_1,\\ldots,b_{a_i})\\in R_i^A}\\{b_1,\\ldots,b_{a_i}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Safe}_{\\tau,k}(q)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;q(A)\\subseteq\\operatorname{adom}_\\tau(A)^k.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\preccurlyeq_{\\rm ad}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ |A|\\subseteq|B|\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^r R_i^A=R_i^B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DomInd}_{\\tau,k}(q)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;(A\\preccurlyeq_{\\rm ad}B\\to q(A)=q(B)).","display":true},{"tex":"q(A)=\\{x\\in S^A\\mid\\exists y\\in|A|\\setminus S^A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":2129,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-active-domain-safe-query]] — 活跃域、安全查询与论域无关性分别定义"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-active-domain-safe-query]]"}],"outgoing":["28e86a5f0243a0ae","4de8e0c8085801f5"]}